<title>USA: Cronos Group auditor resigns.</title>
<headline>Cronos Group auditor resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronos Group said on Friday that Arthur Andersen has resigned as the company's independent auditor as of February 3, 1997.</p>
<p>Replacement auditors are to be announced, the company said.</p>
<p>The reasons behind the resignation were not immediately available.</p>
<p>Also, Graham Dewhirst and Timothy Seymour resigned from the company's board as of December 30, 1996 and Richard Hockman resigned as of February 3, 1997, the company said.  </p>
<p>Cronos Group said Dr. Axel Friedberg has been nominated to the company's board to stand for election at its next annual shareholder meeting.</p>
